00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Install

22
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,500
Insert the handle into the floor washer until it clicks into place.

23
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,500
Start Cleaning

24
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,500
Remove the Clean Water Tank.

25
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Open the tank cap.

26
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,500
Fill the Clean Water Tank with clean tap water.

27
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,500
Add Tineco Cleaning Solution as directed.

28
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Insert the brush roller into the holder and secure it in place.

29
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:03,000
Reinstall the Clean Water Tank.

30
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:05,500
Step on the floorhead and pull the handle backward.

31
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,500
Press the power button to start cleaning.

32
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Start cleaning everyday wet and dry messes.

33
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:14,500
Press the mode button to switch cleaning modes.

34
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:26,500
180° Lay-Flat Design

35
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:26,500
Slides under low furniture to clean hidden dust.

36
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:32,500
Edge Cleaning

37
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:32,500
Cleans close along walls and baseboards.

38
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Self-cleaning

39
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,500
Place the appliance on the charging dock after use.

40
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Press the self-cleaning button to start the cleaning cycle.

41
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,500
Self-Cleaning System

42
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,500
Cleans the brush roller and internal pathway automatically.

43
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Maintain

44
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:46,000
Remove the Dirty Water Tank.

45
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:48,000
Remove the dry filter.

46
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:50,500
Rinse the dry filter with clean water.

47
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Open the Dirty Water Tank lid.

48
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:55,500
Empty the dirty water and remove debris.

49
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,500
Use the cleaning tool to remove remaining debris.

50
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Rinse the Dirty Water Tank thoroughly.

51
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:02,500
Allow all parts to air-dry completely before reassembly.

52
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,500
Reinstall the tank lid and dry filter.

53
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,500
Reinstall the Dirty Water Tank.

54
